flowchart TD
    Q[Research question] --> P[Plan up to 3 search tasks]
    P --> S[Search permitted public sources]
    S --> F[Fetch bounded static HTML]
    F --> E[Extract source passages + provenance IDs]
    E --> C[Compare lexical overlap]
    C --> R[Build extractive report]
    R --> A[Audit IDs + exact excerpt provenance]
    A --> O[Markdown / JSON]

    LLM[Optional LLM planner] -. query suggestions only .-> P
